---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import { GUARANTEE_HOURS, START_FEE } from "../config";
---
<section id="garantie" class="bg-mist pb-20 sm:pb-24 lg:pb-28" aria-labelledby="garantie-titel">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="reveal reveal-scale mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col items-center gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-teal/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-white to-teal/[0.07] p-7 text-center shadow-soft sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-8 sm:p-10 sm:text-left">
      <div class="relative shrink-0">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl bg-teal/25 blur-xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="relative flex size-20 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal to-[#0D9488] text-white shadow-[0_12px_28px_-10px_rgb(20_184_166/0.7)] sm:size-24">
          <Icon name="ShieldCheck" class="size-11 sm:size-12" stroke={1.75} />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 id="garantie-titel" class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.015em] sm:text-3xl">Tijdbespaargarantie</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">
          Bespaar je in de eerste maand niet minstens {GUARANTEE_HOURS} uur? Dan krijg je je startbedrag van €{START_FEE} terug.{" "}
          <span class="font-semibold text-navy">Zo loop je geen enkel risico.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Voorwaarde: je volgt de starttraining en gebruikt de ingerichte tools. We meten de besparing samen bij de check-in na vier weken.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
